     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"{\\left( {\\frac{c}{7}} \\right)^3}\"></span></p>\n<p>Use the exponent distributive rule. When you have a fraction, <span data-math=\"\\frac{a}{b}\"></span>, raised to an exponent, <i>n</i>, then <span data-math=\"{\\left( {\\frac{a}{b}} \\right)^n} = \\frac{{{a^n}}}{{{b^n}}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\left( {\\frac{c}{7}} \\right)^3} = \\frac{{{c^3}}}{{{7^3}}}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac{{{c^3}}}{{{7^3}}}\">\\frac{{{c^3}}}{{{7^3}}}</span>"
    }
